Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Weight fits and CV scores by DP_WORLDS_WEIGHT (pickems
 copy)

Worlds games weight 1, others 1 - DP_WORLDS_WEIGHT, in every logistic fit and
walk-forward score; snapshots record the weight; worker logs go to .cache/
instead of the /tmp directory the original repo's runs share.
